atitude for your amazing participation in the CATHY Days conference. Your=
 presence and active engagement truly made this event a great success!We =
invite you to publicly make your posters and presentations available by a=
ttributing a DOI through trusted repositories like Figshare or Zenodo. Ex=
pand the reach and impact of your research, benefiting the scientific com=
munity.The CATHY Days conference website should be indexed soon on Google=
 and is accessible on GitHub. Find resources, information, and updates co=
nveniently. Photographs capturing memorable moments from the conference c=
an be found on our website . Additionally, a shared drive offers even mor=
e.For those who cannot stand to wait a year to ask questions, a discussio=
n area has been created for the CATHY community. You can utilize it for d=
iscussions, and announcements of future events.Wishing you a productive a=
nd rewarding year ahead. Enjoy your upcoming coupled conferences. We look=
 forward to crossing paths with you again!Best regards,Benjamin Mary, Dan=
